WEBVTT

00:05:59.772 --> 00:06:02.316
It's our idea of family.

00:06:03.317 --> 00:06:06.237
Many non-Western cultures

00:06:06.278 --> 00:06:10.282
have an idea that a family
is something that is imposed on you,

00:06:10.282 --> 00:06:12.368
and it's pretty non-negotiable.

00:06:13.786 --> 00:06:15.204
In the West,

00:06:15.246 --> 00:06:19.333
we have this wonderful,
individualistic consumer culture

00:06:19.375 --> 00:06:22.711
where everything
is pick-and-mix and customized.

00:06:22.711 --> 00:06:24.922
We customize our coffee choice.

00:06:24.922 --> 00:06:26.799
We have our music playlists.

00:06:26.841 --> 00:06:29.468
We get to define our families.